    "owner": "Repository owner Yes on the narrow contract-evolution policy amendment, 2026-10-15; applied here by the bu-mc01y5 coordinator after independent review",
    "date": "2026-10-15",
    "reference": "Authorization bead bu-mc01y5.8 for implementation bead bu-mc01y5.3 (PR #4595, QA agents hold no GitHub credential; publication fails closed with publication_unavailable). Reviewed before: main 04201589cee3edcc9ed067504c5f0d074117b00d; approved subject: PR #4595 head a0240ed3d6272831691a4d5045441d8d724dc7d4. Governing requirement REQ-qa-investigation-dispatch-001 (Investigation Agent Sandbox) of open change confine-qa-publication-authority; the baseline spec openspec/specs/qa-investigation-dispatch/spec.md gains the same ID and scenario and is bound as an exact input record because its pre-change block carries no ID. This exact manifest requires its own independent review and protected-main publication before consumption; provenance text grants no runtime admission."
  },
  "owners": [
