      "reason": "Publication fails closed before any PR payload exists, so the dispatcher never reaches the anonymization validator and emits no escalated event; the case now asserts the patched PR creation is not awaited and no event is recorded."
    },
    {
      "before": "tests/core/qa/test_anonymization_failure.py::test_validation_failure_detail_anonymized",
